> - IdP: Okta, SAML 2.0 app created from your setup guide v2.3.
> - SP-initiated flow. Okta authenticates fine, the POST back to https://halberd.tessera.io/sso/acs returns HTTP 400.
> - Error on your side: "SAML assertion rejected: required attribute 'email' not present (NameID format: urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:1.1:nameid-format:unspecified)"
> - Okta System Log shows the assertion issued with attribute statements firstName, lastName, login. I have a screenshot of the attribute statement if that helps.
> - Metadata XML re-uploaded twice, cert fingerprint matches on both ends.
>
> I also tried switching the NameID format to emailAddress in the app profile, same 400. 12 users affected, all in the pilot group. Would like to get this sorted before Tuesday (Monday is a holiday here) so they can log in on day one.
